# 14. Animation Bake 阶段

函数：

```maxscript
Map_biped_to_FBX()
```

执行顺序：

```text
1. assess_and_create_biped()
2. resize_biped()
3. Bake Animation
```

逐帧 Bake：

```maxscript
for t = start_int to stop_int do
(
    at time t
    (
        animate on
        (
            for b = 1 to local_number_of_items do
            (
                local_retarget_array[b].transform =
                    local_fbx_array[b].transform
            )
        )
    )
)
```

动画阶段处理：

```text
每帧 transform
每帧 pos
每帧 rotation
```

动画阶段不应该处理：

```text
骨长
scale
spineLinks
neckLinks
limb plane 初始化
```

