完整顺序：

```text
FBX Bone
    ↓
统计骨骼数量
    ↓
Create Biped
    ↓
Figure Mode
    ↓
Root
    ↓
Spine
    ↓
Neck
    ↓
Left Arm
    ↓
Right Arm
    ↓
Left Leg
    ↓
Right Leg
    ↓
全骨骼 pos / rotation
    ↓
Exit Figure Mode
    ↓
Bake Animation
```

